still history worth reporting);\n+  Decode does not attest (provhost gate forced the cleaner division —\n+  the full story is in the logbook entry).\n+- Battery harness: `.temp/TASK-260830-1r9wrr/mutate.sh` (gitignored);\n+  log attached as `TASK-260830-1r9wrr_mutation-battery.log`.\n+\n+Ready for review — handed off to review, not accepted as merged work.\n"}}}
